.el .ds Aq '
.TH helligkeit 1  "helligkeit 0.0.1-pre" 
.SH NAME
helligkeit \- Control device linux device brightness
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBhelligkeit\fR [\fB\-l\fR|\fB\-\-like\fR] [\fB\-s\fR|\fB\-\-silent\fR] [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] <\fB\-t\fR|\fB\-\-target\fR> [\fIsubcommands\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Control device linux device brightness
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-t\fR, \fB\-\-target\fR \fI<TARGET>\fR
device to operate on
.TP
\fB\-l\fR, \fB\-\-like\fR
Match devices by substring matching
.TP
\fB\-s\fR, \fB\-\-silent\fR
disable stdout/stderr writes
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR

.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
helligkeit\-info(1)
Device info
.TP
helligkeit\-get(1)
Get current brightness of device
.TP
helligkeit\-set(1)
Set device to value
.TP
helligkeit\-list(1)
List all controllable and supported devices
.TP
helligkeit\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
.SH VERSION
v0.0.1\-pre
